Punishment of ghayr-jaifah: 
Whoever by doing any act with the intention of causing hurt to any person, or with the 
knowledge that he is likely to cause hurt to any person, causes:- 
(i) damihah to any person, shall be liable to daman and may also be punished with 
imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to one year as ta'zir;

